<title>CHINA: China Jan-Nov corn exports up 36.2 pct.</title>
<headline>China Jan-Nov corn exports up 36.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1996-12-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>China exported 150,000 tonnes of corn in the first 11 months of this year, up by 36.2 percent compared with the same year-ago period, customs figures showed on Monday.</p>
<p>There were no exports in October.</p>
<p>China imported 440,000 tonnes tonnes of corn in the first 11 months, down by 89.1 percent from the same period last year, it said.</p>
<p>There were no imports in October.</p>
</text>
